Import "../Computing.lingua"

Build evidence for a concurrent claim under an explicit execution model (@computing-concurrency-evidence: 0, is #chapter, #hephaestus-core "Investigate-concurrent-updates-waiting-and-independent-state-evidence.lingua#r_0003B96BB09E60CBDBD0789C4F") { r_008F6A999F86951A29E8A084CF
A correct final number from one run is weak evidence for a concurrent object. Begin with a specification: admitted inputs, shared and local state, legal atomic operations, completion observations, failures excluded or included, and permitted histories. Separate its safety properties from progress and timing requirements. The previous lessons prove results under sequential consistency and specific synchronization contracts; compiler/language memory rules, visibility between processors and real scheduling require further evidence before applying them to an implementation.

The original counter study has three complementary forms of evidence. Induction proves the locked invariant for arbitrary finite positive-integer job plans. A directly generated serial-prefix state set characterizes reachable locked states independently of the step function. A finite explorer and schedule generator test the implementation on specified cases, including mutation counterexamples. Agreement can expose implementation defects but does not elevate an unmodeled hardware behavior into a proved premise. An oracle that merely calls the same transition code twice would provide much less independence.

For the waiting study, short counterexamples explain why a missed notification and an unchecked wakeup violate different claims. The exhaustive graph bounds safety to the one-publisher, one-waiter, monotone-predicate model. It does not implement a production condition variable or certify an application using one. Report graph states and checked transitions separately from real concurrent executions: the Python program runs as an ordinary single-threaded enumerator.

Apply the shared [Understand scaling limits and the consequences of parallel execution](../../inquiry/reproducible-computation/performance/Scaling-parallelism-and-order.lingua#r_5VWTDE6CWEGWHPNQPKYKAC6PMR) reading carefully. If fixed-work execution time is normalized to one, a serial fraction s and perfectly divisible remaining work on p processors give ideal time s+(1−s)/p and ideal speedup 1/[s+(1−s)/p]. For s=1/4,p=4 this is 16/7, tending to four as p grows. Added synchronization, communication, changed memory behavior and load imbalance can change the model; the graph explorer's duration is not the simulated actors' parallel speedup. Specify task identities and combination order separately from how workers are scheduled.

An observation plan should record enough state to distinguish candidate causes: lost updates, duplicate jobs, numeric overflow, stale reads or incorrect initial data can share a final symptom. Instrumentation can also alter scheduling. A reproducible abstract witness is valuable because it specifies the legal order and states exactly, but a real trace must establish that its events correspond to the abstract operations. Existing [Connect a high-level sum with an encoded loop and a proof](Connect-a-high-level-sum-with-an-encoded-loop-and-a-proof.lingua#r_0778162F79E4E9910D1B03EE10) and [Investigate private state shared pages and complete service effects](Investigate-private-state-shared-pages-and-complete-service-effects.lingua#r_0044D31C76AB50C657C6A092BB) supply representation and execution boundaries; [Review persistence publication recovery and the evidence for them](Review-persistence-publication-and-recovery.lingua#r_0075E888A3D04E2A65A32F27A8) supplies a separate failure boundary. Reuse them without claiming their guarantees automatically compose.

**Work:** write a one-page claim/evidence table for one of the lock variants and one wait variant. Include an invariant, an explicit counterexample to an overstrong claim, assumptions needed for progress, the finite tested domain and a possible implementation observation. Have a critic remove one premise and construct a failure. Revise the claim instead of dismissing a legal counterexample. Deeper memory models, lock-free algorithms, message protocols, distributed failure and operating-system implementation remain later branch formation.

**Continue:** [Investigate concurrent updates waiting and independent state evidence](Investigate-concurrent-updates-waiting-and-independent-state-evidence.lingua#r_0003B96BB09E60CBDBD0789C4F).

**Return:** [Computing](../Computing.lingua#r_02FE84C805C79A9D396F478641).
